{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415011","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415011","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041501101:1":{"text":"음... 허브가 종류가 이렇게나 많다니... 차로 마시기 좋은 허브가 뭐지?","source_cn":"嗯……这么多花草，哪些泡茶会好一点呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23573894E4293EE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041501102:1":{"text":"왜 그래, 라이카? 뭘 그렇게 고민해?","source_cn":"怎么了，莱卡，为什么犹豫不决的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92CA3DFDEC1ABC13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041501103:1":{"text":"평소에는 패리사 네가 만들어 준 티백을 마시는데, 미스테리 하우스는 그냥 원재료를 줘서...","source_cn":"平时都是喝帕瑞莎你处理好的茶包，但神秘屋提供的材料都是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEB2AEB4493ADC62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041501104:1":{"text":"게다가 건조까지 된 상태라 어디에서 나는 꽃인지, 약초인지 구분을 못 하겠어.","source_cn":"而且很多还经过了干制处理，我有点分不出来究竟是哪里的花...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA7E43FB3C101BF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041501105:1":{"text":"여기에 온갖 재료들이 다 있어. 거의 다 땅거미 숲에서 못 보던 것들이야. 심지어 특별한 지역에서만 나는 향신료도 있는데?","source_cn":"这里储存了来自各地的材料，很多都和薄暮丛林不同，甚至还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD570F823768E8D98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041501106:1":{"text":"나한테 맡겨줘. 너희 입맛이 딱 맞는 걸로 골라줄게. 물론 각자 다른 재료로 말이야.","source_cn":"交给我吧，我来为你们挑选适合的口味——当然，会用一些不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCD766150782B064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041501107:1":{"text":"여기에 있는 재료를 벌써 다 파악한 거야? 역시 패리사는 역시 대단해!","source_cn":"你已经都分清楚这里的存货了吗？真不愧是帕瑞莎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x070AB976B1AC6E8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:帕瑞莎":{"text":"패리사","source":"帕瑞莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}